# Vercel only needs to build the PWA (scripts/build-pwa.mjs reads app/ and
# writes pwa/). Everything below is backend/infra that must never be picked
# up as a Python serverless function or bundled into the deployment -
# api/**/*.py + root requirements.txt was being auto-detected as Vercel
# Python Functions, which broke the build (it's meant to run as our own
# FastAPI server, not as Vercel functions).
api/
db/
infra/
gateway/
firmware/
shared/
web/
docs/
.venv/
.data/
